<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BTR Nylex issues A$200 mln MTN issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BTR Nylex issues A$200 mln MTN issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTR Nylex, a wholly-owned subsidiary of BTR Plc, said on Tuesday it has launched a A$200 million note issue off its recently establised A$500 million Medium Term Note programme.</p>
</text>
